\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Closed-loop AudioTwin architecture. An estimated audiogram defines the feasible hearing-aid processing space. The controller presents a pair of feasible settings, receives a binary preference from the simulated listener, updates the preference model and recommends the setting with the highest posterior mean utility. The hidden oracle is used only to generate simulated feedback and evaluate recommendations.}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
